    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d133">

                <pb facs="0178" n="168" xml:id="pg168"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EAC/1–645</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20232</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-06">January 6,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received January 12.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to telegram No. 18 of
                    January 5, 9 p.m., Comea 143, which reported the establishment of an Allied
                    Consultation Committee in the European Advisory Commission to consult with
                    representatives of certain European United Nations Governments, I have the honor
                    to transmit copies of a Summary of the Instrument of Unconditional Surrender of
                    Germany which has been prepared in the Commission for the purpose of serving as
                    a basis for discussion in the meetings of the new Committee.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>For the Ambassador: <lb/>
                    <signed>E. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Allan Lightner, Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary, U. S. Delegation,<lb/>European Advisory
                        Commission</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d133-a1.xml" xpointer="d133-a1"/>
            </div>
